OL,4,CBangladesh's ex-PM Sheikh Hasina says  
OL,5,Cshe plans to return on 16 December     
OL,6,GBangladesh's former prime minister     
OL,7,GSheikh Hasina has said she plans to    
OL,8,Greturn home on 16 December, more than  
OL,9,Gtwo years after a popular uprising     
OL,10,Gforced her from power.                 
OL,12,FHasina, who has lived in exile in      
OL,13,FDelhi since August 2024, has asked the 
OL,14,FBangladeshi government to fly her back 
OL,15,Fto Dhaka, her spokesperson said.       
OL,17,FThe announcement comes amid renewed    
OL,18,Funrest in Bangladesh, where supporters 
OL,19,Fof her Awami League party have staged  
OL,20,Fprotests despite a ban on its          
OL,21,Factivities.                            
